From 940eeee013594125d57f27b783486ce35cd12a67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wooseong Kim <innocarpe@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 23:13:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] feat(pager): render DeepSeek status with session-safe polling

Wire DeepSeek balance and cache-hit status into the pager bottom row.
The status probe is bound to the current session, stops after an explicit
unsupported-extension response for that session, retries transient failures,
and drops stale in-flight results without changing xAI session behavior.

